{"id":"be1714cefc9afa6afca7078a9c203627a6f37a07","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230556","title":"那么问题来了， codex 有机会改手机号吗","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"cat55","excerpt":"OpenAI - @cat55 - 目前是不能改的，一堆 giffgaff 都被封了，绑了 codex 咋办pro 用户可能还好，plus 的土区 499 续费的号咋办，可不能随便就扔啊","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>目前是不能改的，一堆 giffgaff 都被封了，绑了 codex 咋办\npro 用户可能还好，plus 的土区 499 续费的号咋办，可不能随便就扔啊</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/Codex\"><li></li> Codex</a><a href=\"/tag/手机号\"><li></li> 手机号</a><a href=\"/tag/账号\"><li></li> 账号</a></P><p><span>15 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-07-29 22:43:15 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914278\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d378980e43883f1b03cae2f3a89bc0b4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"KCL\" data-uid=\"690278\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/KCL\">KCL</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 00:09:22 +08:00\">22h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>能携号转网吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914285\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/49be35679a0b8f8dcb2b53f4d091cbc2?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"skyRay\" data-uid=\"253242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/skyRay\">skyRay</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 00:14:41 +08:00\">22h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>绑 whatsapp 然后开二验吧，最好是申请 PAC 携号转网<br>能苟多久苟多久，土区续费也不稳定，说不定哪天就涨了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914299\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/90a4/c283/228831_normal.png?m=1721937386\" alt=\"longxk\" data-uid=\"228831\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/longxk\">longxk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 00:28:11 +08:00\">22h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/skyRay\">skyRay</a> 怎么绑定 Whatsapp 呢？<br>我在账户安全下面打开 Text message 多因素认证后，直接跳出来让我输入手机号码，没有看到 WhatsApp 选项呀。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914327\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/06cd3b8f55457eda1ccc4b4640fffbfd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ffalex\" data-uid=\"46426\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ffalex\">ffalex</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 00:49:42 +08:00\">21h 58m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>运气好，我的 codex 和 claude 都没有提示过绑定号码，appstore 绑定的账户也可以申诉改</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914337\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2a4691887b2379eab55260568f11722a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"loveour\" data-uid=\"172765\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/loveour\">loveour</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 01:03:06 +08:00\">21h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>改不了。我的是 3 年前的账号了，当时绑的号码早没了，现在只能指望它不会突然要我验证。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914340\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6ae9/1bf1/318241_normal.png?m=1635526742\" alt=\"oneend\" data-uid=\"318241\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/oneend\">oneend</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 01:07:55 +08:00\">21h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>确实改不了, 我的操作是订阅过期, 然后注销了.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914734\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d961/3cd9/563553_normal.png?m=1749532589\" alt=\"SayHelloHi\" data-uid=\"563553\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SayHelloHi\">SayHelloHi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 09:19:56 +08:00\">13h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/oneend\">oneend</a></p><p>+1</p><p>一样的操作 刚刚取消订阅</p><p>准备重新绑定新手机号和新 ChatGPT 账号</p><p>本来注册 gg 就是来使用 Codex 的</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914915\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b16b/362c/577927_normal.png?m=1736328705\" alt=\"duty\" data-uid=\"577927\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/duty\">duty</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 09:48:07 +08:00\">13h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 的账号登录方式那么多，又不一定非得用手机号验证</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915148\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/644b/522e/43395_normal.png?m=1442661394\" alt=\"lucifer9\" data-uid=\"43395\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lucifer9\">lucifer9</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 10:17:50 +08:00\">12h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>要不试试打开那个什么 advanced account security<br>打开以后可以看到下面发短信那里压根儿就不让选了...</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/NB5hEz4.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NB5hEz4.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915438\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/af5e/0385/651753_normal.png?m=1695968108\" alt=\"sleek7671\" data-uid=\"651753\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sleek7671\">sleek7671</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 10:50:48 +08:00\">11h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 不能改手机号，我记得我注册的时候就有手机号验证，后来注册又不需要了，但是那个号里的手机号一直在，我也问过客服，说不能改来着</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915630\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f5dc/0915/43239_normal.png?m=1772119990\" alt=\"wclebb\" data-uid=\"43239\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wclebb\">wclebb</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 11:15:15 +08:00\">11h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/duty\">duty</a> 不是因为登陆方式的问题，是因为有时强制验证码。<br>而这手机号是一次性绑死，除了注销，别无他法。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915796\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8e1f/822f/402186_normal.png?m=1772587036\" alt=\"0xbe\" data-uid=\"402186\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/0xbe\">0xbe</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 11:38:48 +08:00\">11h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>passkey</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918419\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/49be35679a0b8f8dcb2b53f4d091cbc2?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"skyRay\" data-uid=\"253242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/skyRay\">skyRay</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 22:43:15 +08:00\">5 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/longxk\">longxk</a> 手机号注册 whatsapp ，后面 chatgpt 需要验证的时候选择发消息到 whatsapp ；然后打开 